<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>VX6 機器人 | 企業級支援系統</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;800&family=Inter:wght@400;600&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>

<body class="public-layout">
    <header>
        <div class="logo">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i> VX6 機器人
        </div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#features">功能特色</a>
            <a href="#pricing">企業方案</a>
            <% if (user) { %>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="auth-btn glow">控制台 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                <% } else { %>
                    <a href="/auth/discord" class="auth-btn glow"><i class="fa-brands fa-discord"></i> 使用 Discord 登入</a>
                    <% } %>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero-section">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="badge">v2.0 全新上線</span>
                <h1>打造專業級的 <br><span class="gradient-text">社群支援體驗</span></h1>
                <p>專為規模化設計的高級 Discord 工單系統。具備 HTML 對話紀錄、詳細數據分析與無縫整合功能。</p>
                <div class="cta-group">
                    <a href="/auth/discord" class="btn-primary">立即開始</a>
                    <a href="#features" class="btn-secondary">了解更多</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-visual">
                <div class="glass-card float">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="dot red"></div>
                        <div class="dot yellow"></div>
                        <div class="dot green"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="msg">
                            <div class="avatar"></div>
                            <div class="lines">
                                <div class="line short"></div>
                                <div class="line long"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="msg right">
                            <div class="lines">
                                <div class="line medium"></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="avatar blue"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="features" class="features-section">
            <h2>強大功能</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-code"></i>
                    <h3>HTML 對話紀錄</h3>
                    <p>將對話紀錄匯出為精美易讀的 HTML 網頁格式，永久保存完整溝通內容。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
                    <h3>數據分析儀表板</h3>
                    <p>透過即時圖表追蹤團隊績效與工單解決狀態。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                    <h3>進階安全性</h3>
                    <p>採用角色權限控制與獨立的環境變數隔離，確保資料安全。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container footer-content"
            style="text-align: center; padding: 2rem 0; color: var(--text-secondary);">
            <p>&copy; 2024 VX6 System. 安全。高效。強大。</p>
            <div class="footer-links" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                <a href="/terms" style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px;">服務條款</a>
                <a href="/privacy"
                    style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px;">隱私權政策</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>